OL,3,GNEWSAUp to 50% of donated items        
OL,4,Aunsellable for charity                 
OL,6,FA charity shop has said about 30 to 50%
OL,7,Fof items given to its donation centre  
OL,8,Fare not sellable because they are not  
OL,9,Fin good enough condition.              
OL,11,FAcorn Enterprises said items it had    
OL,12,Fdonated included unwashed socks and    
OL,13,Funderwear, which then takes time and   
OL,14,Fresources to remove.                   
OL,16,FVolunteers and staff at the charity's  
OL,17,Fdonation centre spend hours sorting    
OL,18,Fthrough the items.                     
