OL,3,GNEWSAUp to 50% of donated items        
OL,4,Aunsellable for charity                 
OL,6,FCameron Honey from the charity said it 
OL,7,Fwas grateful for donations but "it     
OL,8,Fwould be nice to see people taking     
OL,9,Fmaybe a bit more care in what they     
OL,10,Fdonate".                               
